a small platform, then having a preorder might actually hurt your sales because people will wait until the launch day to buy it. Because they think, oh, it's available now, I'll wait till launch day to get it cheaper. So I would say, unless you have a large platform or you've already built some momentum, I'd hold off on preorders. That way, you can build anticipation and create urgency around launch day. The goal is to maximize sales on launch day, not necessarily to sell a bunch of books right away.

